abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for generating trustworthy
  test cases with Retrieval-Augmented Generation and AI agents. The work
  introduces an Evidence-Retrieve-Design-Trace-Review-Evaluate-Gate model
  spanning requirements, acceptance criteria, project-scoped retrieval,
  source provenance, risk analysis, structured test generation, positive and
  negative coverage, authorization and state-transition testing, deterministic
  traceability and coverage, duplicate detection, unsupported expected results,
  assumptions, LLM-as-a-Judge governance, human review, versioned evaluation
  datasets, candidate-baseline comparison, repeated-run stability, automation
  handoff, observability, cost and production-to-regression learning.
